{"seq":1,"slug":"rsbuild","title":"Rsbuild 构建框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/rsbuild","wordCount":560,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"rsbuild-构建框架\">Rsbuild 构建框架</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rsbuild 是一层「构建框架」，而不是打包器本身：它把 Rspack（Rust 版 Webpack）作为打包核心、SWC 作为转译核心，再在上面封装开箱即用的默认配置、开发服务器与插件体系。它要解决的问题是 Webpack 配置繁琐——把 Loader/Plugin 的重复组装收敛为一组约定。使用它时，理解「框架 / 打包器 / 转译器」三层职责的划分，比记住具体配置项更重要。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rsbuild-概述\">Rsbuild 概述</h2><p>Rsbuild 是由字节跳动 Web Infra 团队开源的新一代构建框架。它构建在 Rspack（Rust 版 Webpack）之上，提供开箱即用的构建能力。Rsbuild 的定位是&quot;更快的 Webpack 替代方案&quot;——它兼容大部分 Webpack 的生态，但构建速度提升了 5-10 倍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Rsbuild 技术栈&#10;        RSBUILD[Rsbuild&lt;br/&gt;构建框架]&#10;        RSPACK[Rspack&lt;br/&gt;Rust 打包器]&#10;        SWC_CORE[SWC&lt;br/&gt;Rust 转译器]&#10;&#10;        RSBUILD --&gt; RSPACK&#10;        RSPACK --&gt; SWC_CORE&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 对标关系&#10;        CRA[Create React App] -.-&gt;|对标| RSBUILD&#10;        WEBPACK[Webpack] -.-&gt;|对标| RSPACK&#10;        BABEL[Babel] -.-&gt;|对标| SWC_CORE&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Rsbuild 技术栈\n        RSBUILD[Rsbuild&lt;br/&gt;构建框架]\n        RSPACK[Rspack&lt;br/&gt;Rust 打包器]\n        SWC_CORE[SWC&lt;br/&gt;Rust 转译器]\n\n        RSBUILD --&gt; RSPACK\n        RSPACK --&gt; SWC_CORE\n    end\n    subgraph 对标关系\n        CRA[Create React App] -.-&gt;|对标| RSBUILD\n        WEBPACK[Webpack] -.-&gt;|对标| RSPACK\n        BABEL[Babel] -.-&gt;|对标| SWC_CORE\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"快速开始\">快速开始</h2><h3 id=\"创建项目\">创建项目</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm create rsbuild@latest&#10;&#10;# 或使用已有项目&#10;npm add @rsbuild/core -D\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rsbuild@latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或使用已有项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @rsbuild/core</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// rsbuild.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@rsbuild/core&#39;;&#10;import { pluginReact } from &#39;@rsbuild/plugin-react&#39;;&#10;import { pluginSass } from &#39;@rsbuild/plugin-sass&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  plugins: [pluginReact(), pluginSass()],&#10;  source: {&#10;    entry: {&#10;      index: &#39;./src/index.tsx&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    alias: {&#10;      &#39;@&#39;: &#39;./src&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@components&#39;: &#39;./src/components&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  output: {&#10;    target: &#39;web&#39;,&#10;    distPath: {&#10;      root: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;      js: &#39;static/js&#39;,&#10;      css: &#39;static/css&#39;,&#10;      image: &#39;static/image&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    assetPrefix: &#39;/&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  html: {&#10;    title: &#39;My App&#39;,&#10;    favicon: &#39;./public/favicon.ico&#39;,&#10;    template: &#39;./public/index.html&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rsbuild.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rsbuild/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { pluginReact } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rsbuild/plugin-react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { pluginSass } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@rsbuild/plugin-sass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pluginReact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pluginSass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      index: </span><span style=\"col